README.md:1120:| `TestCombat` ([Models/TestCombat.cs](Test/Models/TestCombat.cs)) | 4 | Attacks reduce HP. Enough attacks kill (HP ends at exactly 0 and `OnKilled` fires). Consumables heal, are used up and are unequipped. Two monsters with the same weapon type don't share action messages. |
